      <link>https://justthenews.com/government/congress/ccp-linked-singham-networks-tax-exempt-status-remains-groups-avoid-fara-after?utm_source=justthenews.com&amp;utm_medium=feed&amp;utm_campaign=external-news-aggregators</link>
      <description>Sen. Grassley told AG Bondi last year that they have “a duty to ensure compliance with the Foreign Agents Registration Act [...] to combat adversarial foreign governments from influencing public policy and opinion in the United States.” The far-left activist network launched by Neville Roy Singham has been the focus of investigations in the House and Senate, but it is unclear whether the DOJ or IRS are investigating too.</description>
